# SATYAK — Complete Full-Stack AICTE Application Validation & Compliance Platform

## ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, product designer, UX architect and AI application developer.

Build a complete, polished, responsive, functional web application named **SATYAK** for the problem statement:

**AI-Powered Application Validation, Document Authentication and Regulatory Compliance Verification for AICTE.**

The application must help technical institutions prepare approval-related applications and help authorized reviewers identify missing documents, expired certificates, inconsistent information, potential document anomalies and regulatory compliance gaps.

This is a hackathon prototype intended to demonstrate a practical solution to AICTE's application validation problem.

Do not build only a landing page or static UI. Build a complete, interactive, end-to-end application with a functional frontend, validation logic, document-upload workflow, results dashboard, institution workspace, officer review workspace, verification simulator, compliance guide and audit trail.

Prioritize a working implementation that can be generated, tested and demonstrated today.

Do not ask unnecessary questions. Make sensible implementation decisions and begin building the application.

